# todo-stage.md — Template definition (todo list + current stage)

## Expression

- Registration only, no explanation
- Table form: todo item / status / priority
- Current stage: one-line positioning + stage boundary
- Changes recorded explicitly

## Section hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Todo list and current stage

### H2 (required)
- Current stage: name / positioning / boundary (itemized)
- Todo list table: id / todo / status / priority

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional sections

- [optional] Pause point: resumable position record
- [optional] Changelog: date / change
